---
import WpLayout from '../../layouts/WpLayout.astro';import {catalog,u} from '../../lib/cars24';const q=(Astro.url.searchParams.get('q')||'').trim();const data=q?(await catalog()).filter((m:any)=>`${m.make_name} ${m.model_name}`.toLowerCase().includes(q.toLowerCase())).slice(0,12):[];
---
<WpLayout title="Пошук — Cars24"><main class="c24-zero-page"><div class="c24-shell"><header class="c24-search-results-head"><span class="c24-zero-kicker">ПОШУК CARS24</span><h1>{q?`Результати: ${q}`:'Пошук'}</h1><form><input name="q" value={q} placeholder="VIN, марка, модель, стаття..."><button>Знайти</button></form></header><div class="c24-search-results-layout"><section class="c24-search-results-list">{data.length?data.map((m:any)=><article><div><span>{m.vehicle_type}</span><h2><a href={u(`/${m.vehicle_type==='moto'?'moto':'cars'}/${m.make_slug}/${m.model_slug}/`)}>{m.make_name} {m.model_name}</a></h2><p>{m.year_from||''}–{m.year_to||'актуально'}</p></div><a class="c24-search-arrow" href={u(`/${m.vehicle_type==='moto'?'moto':'cars'}/${m.make_slug}/${m.model_slug}/`)}>→</a></article>):<div class="c24-zero-empty"><p>Нічого не знайдено.</p></div>}</section><aside class="c24-search-help"><span>CARS24</span><h3>Не знайшли?</h3><p>Напишіть нам VIN або модель.</p><a href="https://t.me/Egor_Cars24">Написати</a></aside></div></div></main></WpLayout>
